<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="am">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>መተባበር ጠቅላላ የመስታወት ሥራና አቅርቦት | 22 ገጾች</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+Ethiopic:wght@300;400;600;700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --gold: #d4af37;
            --gold-bright: #f5d76e;
            --text-light: #f8f9fa;
            --text-muted: #cbd5e1;
            --glass-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            --glass-border: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.28);
            --transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Noto Sans Ethiopic', 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #0a0a0c;
            color: var(--text-light);
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            transition: background 0.6s ease;
        }

        /* Top Navigation Bar */
        header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(8, 8, 12, 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            z-index: 1000;
            padding: 14px 5%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            color: var(--gold);
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .main-nav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 14px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .main-nav button {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            color: var(--text-light);
            padding: 7px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .main-nav button:hover, .main-nav button.active-nav {
            border-color: var(--gold);
            color: var(--gold);
            background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.1);
        }

        .page-indicator {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), #a67c00);
            color: #080808;
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        /* 22-Page Quick Switcher Bar */
        .page-strip {
            position: fixed;
            top: 64px;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(15, 15, 20, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            z-index: 999;
            padding: 8px 5%;
            display: flex;
            gap: 6px;
            overflow-x: auto;
            scrollbar-width: none;
        }

        .page-strip::-webkit-scrollbar {
            display: none;
        }

        .page-num-btn {
            min-width: 34px;
            height: 30px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .page-num-btn:hover, .page-num-btn.active {
            background: var(--gold);
            color: #000;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* Page Container */
        main {
            padding-top: 120px;
            padding-bottom: 90px;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .page {
            display: none;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 24px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
            animation: fadeSlide 0.45s ease forwards;
        }

        .page.active {
            display: block;
        }

        @keyframes fadeSlide {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        /* Typography & Cards */
        .page-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 5px 14px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            color: var(--gold-bright);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        h1, h2 {
            color: var(--gold-bright);
            line-height: 1.3;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        h1 { font-size: 2.4rem; }
        h2 { font-size: 1.95rem; }

        p.lead {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.08rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .grid-2 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 28px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .grid-3 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
            gap: 22px;
        }

        .glass-card {
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 24px;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .glass-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--gold);
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .glass-card h3 {
            color: var(--gold);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .photo-frame {
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 2px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.35);
            background: #000;
            position: relative;
        }

        .photo-frame img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 310px;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }

        .photo-frame:hover img {
            transform: scale(1.04);
        }

        .photo-caption {
            padding: 14px 18px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);
            color: var(--gold-bright);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .btn-gold {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold-bright), var(--gold));
            color: #080808;
            padding: 12px 26px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .btn-gold:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.4);
        }

        .phone-box {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .phone-box:hover {
            background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.18);
            transform: translateX(6px);
        }

        /* Bottom Next / Prev Bar */
        .bottom-controls {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(8, 8, 12, 0.92);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            padding: 12px 6%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .nav-arrow {
            background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            color: var(--gold-bright);
            padding: 8px 18px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .nav-arrow:hover {
            background: var(--gold);
            color: #000;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            h1 { font-size: 1.75rem; }
            h2 { font-size: 1.45rem; }
            .main-nav button { padding: 5px 9px; font-size: 0.8rem; }
            .brand span { display: none; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Top Main Menu -->
    <header>
        <div class="brand" onclick="goToPage(1)">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-gem"></i>
            <span>መተባበር የመስታወት ሥራ</span>
        </div>
        <nav class="main-nav">
            <button onclick="goToPage(1)" id="nav-home">መግቢያ</button>
            <button onclick="goToPage(2)" id="nav-about">ስለኛ</button>
            <button onclick="goToPage(3)" id="nav-services">አገልግሎት</button>
            <button onclick="goToPage(22)" id="nav-contact">ማነጋገሪያ</button>
        </nav>
        <div class="page-indicator" id="page-counter">ገጽ 1 / 22</div>
    </header>

    <!-- 22-Page Direct Switcher Strip -->
    <div class="page-strip" id="page-strip"></div>

    <main>
        <!-- PAGE 1: መግቢያ (Home) -->
        <section class="page active" id="page-1" data-bg="linear-gradient(135deg, #09090b 0%, #1c1917 100%)">
            <span class="page-badge">ገጽ 1 — መግቢያ</span>
            <h1>መተባበር ጠቅላላ የመስታወት ሥራና አቅርቦት</h1>
            <p class="lead">ለዘመናዊ ሪል እስቴቶች፣ ለአፓርትመንቶች፣ ለቢሮዎች እና ለመኖሪያ ቤቶች ዓለም አቀፍ ደረጃቸውን የጠበቁ የመስታወት ሥራዎችን እና አቅርቦቶችን በላቀ ጥራት እናቀርባለን።</p>
            <div class="grid-2">
                <div>
                    <div class="glass-card" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                        <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-award"></i> ዋና አገልግሎቶቻችን</h3>
                        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.9;">
                            • የሪል እስቴት መስታወት<br>
                            • የአፓርትመንቶች መስታወት<br>
                            • ዘመናዊ የሻወር ቦክስ (Shower Box)<br>
                            • ፍሬምለስ ፓርትሽን (Frameless Partition)<br>
                            • ሀንዲሪል (Handrail)<br>
                            • የተለያየ ከለር ያላቸው መስታወቶች አቅርቦት
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <button class="btn-gold" onclick="goToPage(22)"><i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i> አሁኑኑ ያነጋግሩን</button>
                </div>
                <div class="photo-frame">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="መተባበር የመስታወት ሥራ">
                    <div class="photo-caption"><span>ዘመናዊ የመስታወት ዲዛይን</span><span>መተባበር</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- PAGE 2: ስለኛ (About Us) -->
        <section class="page" id="page-2" data-bg="linear-gradient(135deg, #0c192c 0%, #172a46 100%)">
            <span class="page-badge">ገጽ 2 — ስለኛ</span>
            <h2>ስለ መተባበር ጠቅላላ የመስታወት ሥራና አቅርቦት</h2>
            <p class="lead">ድርጅታችን በዘርፉ ሰፊ ልምድ ባላቸው ባለሙያዎች የተደራጀ ሲሆን፣ ጥንካሬን፣ ውበትን እና ደህንነትን ያጣመሩ የመስታወት ውጤቶችን ለደንበኞቻችን ያቀርባል።</p>
            <div class="grid-3">
                <div class="glass-card">
                    <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> አስተማማኝ ጥራት</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted);">ለግንባታ እና ለውስጥ ዲዛይን የሚውሉ ወፍራም እና ጠንካራ የደህንነት መስታወቶችን (Tempered Glass) እናቀርባለን።</p>
                </div>
                <div class="glass-card">
                    <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-compass-drafting"></i> ዘመናዊ ዲዛይን</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted);">የቤትዎን ወይም የሕንፃዎን ውበት በእጥፍ የሚያሳድጉ ፍሬምለስ እና ባለቀለም መስታወቶችን በትክክለኛ ልኬት እንገጥማለን።</p>
                </div>
                <div class="glass-card">
                    <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-clock"></i> ፈጣን አቅርቦት</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted);">ለሪል እስቴቶችና ለአፓርትመንት ፕሮጀክቶች በተያዘላቸው የጊዜ ገደብ መሠረት ሥራውን አጠናቅቀን እናስረክባለን።</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- PAGE 3: የሪል እስቴት መስታወት (Real Estate Glass) -->
        <section class="page" id="page-3" data-bg="linear-gradient(135deg, #09221c 0%, #133b32 100%)">
            <span class="page-badge">ገጽ 3 — አገልግሎት ፩</span>
            <h2>የሪል እስቴት መስታወት ሥራና አቅርቦት</h2>
            <p class="lead">ለትላልቅ የሪል እስቴት መንደሮች እና የንግድ ሕንፃዎች የሚሆኑ ሙቀትና ድምፅ የሚከላከሉ ዘመናዊ የመስታወት ገጽታዎችን እናቀርባለን።</p>
            <div class="grid-2">
                <div class="photo-frame">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486406146926-c627a92ad1ab?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="የሪል እስቴት መስታወት">
                    <div class="photo-caption"><span>የሪል እስቴት ሕንፃ መስታወት</span><span>ፎቶ 1</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="glass-card">
                    <h3>ለሪል እስቴት ፕሮጀክቶች ልዩ ጥቅሞች</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.9;">
                        ✓ የፀሐይ ጨረርን የሚመጥኑ (Reflective & Tinted) መስታወቶች<br>
                        ✓ በብዛት ለሚታዘዙ ፕሮጀክቶች ልዩ ቅናሽ<br>
                        ✓ ከአሉሚኒየም እና ከብረት ፍሬሞች ጋር የተቀናጀ ገጠማ<br>
                        ✓ ረጅም ዕድሜ እና ዋስትና ያለው አቅርቦት
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- PAGE 4: የአፓርትመንቶች መስታወት (Apartment Glass) -->
        <section class="page" id="page-4" data-bg="linear-gradient(135deg, #1b112c 0%, #2d1b4e 100%)">
            <span class="page-badge">ገጽ 4 — አገልግሎት ፪</span>
            <h2>የአፓርትመንቶች መስታወት</h2>
            <p class="lead">ለመኖሪያ አፓርትመንቶች ሰፋፊ መስኮቶች፣ የበረንዳ በሮች እና የውስጥ ክፍል መስታወቶችን በከፍተኛ ጥንቃቄ እና ውበት እንሠራለን።</p>
            <div class="grid-2">
                <div class="glass-card">
                    <h3>የአፓርትመንት መስታወት አማራጮች</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.9;">
                        ✓ ተንሸራታች የበረንዳ መስታወት በሮች (Sliding Glass Doors)<br>
                        ✓ ድምፅ የማያስገቡ ድርብ መስታወቶች (Double Glazed)<br>
                        ✓ ለሳሎን እና ለመኝታ ቤት የሚሆኑ ዘመናዊ መስኮቶች
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="photo-frame">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1545324418-cc1a3fa10c00?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="የአፓርትመንቶች መስታወት">
                    <div class="photo-caption"><span>ዘመናዊ አፓርትመንት መስታወት</span><span>ፎቶ 2</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- PAGE 5: የሻወር ቦክስ (Shower Box) -->
        <section class="page" id="page-5" data-bg="linear-gradient(135deg, #08232c 0%, #103c4a 100%)">
            <span class="page-badge">ገጽ 5 — አገልግሎት ፫</span>
            <h2>ዘመናዊ የሻወር ቦክስ (Shower Box)</h2>
            <p class="lead">መታጠቢያ ቤትዎን ንፁህ፣ ደረቅ እና ባለ 5 ኮከብ ሆቴል ደረጃ የሚያደርጉ የቴምፐርድ መስታወት ሻወር ቦክሶችን እንሠራለን።</p>
