                <div class="photo-frame">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584622650111-993a426fbf0a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="የሻወር ቦክስ">
                    <div class="photo-caption"><span>ፍሬምለስ የሻወር ቦክስ</span><span>ፎቶ 3</span></div>
