                        <span>0943399605</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="glass-card" style="text-align: center;">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-gem" style="font-size: 2.5rem; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 14px;"></i>
                    <h3>ጥራት፣ ውበት እና ታማኝነት!</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 20px;">የእርስዎን ሕንፃ እና ቤት በዘመናዊ መስታወት ለማስዋብ ሁልጊዜ ዝግጁ ነን።</p>
                    <a href="tel:0965642265" class="btn-gold"><i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i> ቀጥታ ይደውሉ</a>
